story-context.interfaces:
**PWA Manifest Icon Interface:**

```typescript
// app/manifest.ts icon array structure
icons: [
  {
    src: string,        // Path to icon file (e.g., '/icons/icon-192.png')
    sizes: string,      // Icon dimensions (e.g., '192x192')
    type: string,       // MIME type (e.g., 'image/png')
    purpose: string     // 'any' | 'maskable' | 'any maskable'
  }
]
```

**iOS Meta Tags Interface:**

```typescript
// app/layout.tsx metadata.appleWebApp
export const metadata = {
  appleWebApp: {
    capable: boolean,              // Enable full-screen mode on iOS
    statusBarStyle: string,        // 'default' | 'black' | 'black-translucent'
    title: string                  // App title when added to home screen
  },
  icons: {
    apple: string                  // Path to apple-touch-icon (180x180)
  }
}
```

**Theme Color Interface:**

```typescript
// Manifest theme colors
{
  theme_color: string,      // Hex color for OS integration (e.g., '#000000')
  background_color: string  // Hex color for splash screen background (e.g., '#ffffff')
}

// HTML meta tag (add to layout.tsx metadata)
{
  themeColor: string        // Should match manifest.ts theme_color
}
```

**Icon File Naming Convention:**

- Standard icons: icon-{size}.png (e.g., icon-192.png, icon-512.png)
- Maskable icon: maskable-icon.png (512x512)
- Apple touch icon: apple-touch-icon.png (180x180)
- Favicon: favicon.ico (multi-size: 16x16, 32x32, 48x48)
